  data: {
    LLM: "Do not use standard Blackjack strategy! The missing 10s change the math significantly. You hit more often on stiff hands (12-16) because the bust card (10) is gone. You double less often against dealer's 2-6 because dealer is less likely to bust.\n\nSurrender: Use the 'Double Rescue' option freely if your double goes bad (e.g., Doubling 11, getting a 2 for 13 against a dealer Ace? Surrender).\n\nBonus Hunting: Sometimes hitting a hard 14 (composed of 7-7) against a dealer 6 is correct to fish for the third 7.",
